       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LEDGER-PROC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 CUSTOMER-RECORD.
          05 CUSTOMER-NAME PIC X(30).
          05 CUSTOMER-AGE  PIC 99.
       01 ACCOUNT-METADATA.
          05 INTEREST-RATE PIC 9V99 VALUE 2.15.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF CUSTOMER-AGE > 65
               MOVE 3.50 TO INTEREST-RATE
           ELSE
               MOVE 2.15 TO INTEREST-RATE.
           DISPLAY "INTEREST RATE APPLIED: " INTEREST-RATE.
           GOBACK.
